{"id":"curioso","lemma":"curioso","pos":"adj","rank":1771,"glosses":["curious, inquisitive (person)","interesting","funny, strange, odd"],"ipa":"/kuˈɾjoso/","forms":{"feminine":"curiosa","masculinePlural":"curiosos","femininePlural":"curiosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-curioso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Soy tan curioso como tú.","en":"I'm just as curious as you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/578447"},{"text":"Ella es curiosa por naturaleza.","en":"She's inquisitive by nature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641928"},{"text":"Los delfines son curiosos.","en":"Dolphins are curious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636833"},{"text":"Los gatos son criaturas curiosas por naturaleza.","en":"Cats are curious creatures by nature."},{"text":"Tan solo soy curioso.","en":"I'm just curious."}]}